80
00:03:13,640 --> 00:03:14,900
Everyone gets a share!

81
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:15,800
Come on.

82
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:17,400
Get one for us.

83
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:18,440
Give us one too.

84
00:03:18,440 --> 00:03:19,360
Everyone gets one.

85
00:03:19,360 --> 00:03:21,079
